Name: Chrome Platform Status Dashboard (chromestatus.com)
Short Name: chromium-dashboard
URL: https://github.com/GoogleChrome/chromium-dashboard
License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE
Version: 2026.11.0
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/chromium-dashboard
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/chromium-dashboard

Description:
Official Chrome Platform Status dashboard (chromestatus.com) tracking Web Platform features,
Blink intents (Intent to Prototype, Experiment, Ship), Origin Trials, and Milestone schedules.

Local Modifications:
- Migrated and integrated into yolo-bun (packages/yolo-bun-plugin/src/chromium-toolkit.ts) as yolo-bun:chromium-dashboard.
- Tracks Blink shipping milestones, WebGPU, Speculation Rules v2, View Transitions Level 2, and WebMCP.
